// @reject: an error pattern names its message or ignores it with `_`; it does
// @reject: not compare it. `##A(1)` and `##A("x")` are refused — to test the
// @reject: text, bind it and compare in the arm (D7, 2026-09-29).
r = ##A("x")
?? r {
    ##A("x") => { >> "x" ¶ }
    _        => { >> "o" ¶ }
}
